What:		/sys/class/spi_master/spiN/device/dma_stats
Date:		November 2026
Description:
		Read-only ESP32-S31 GPSPI DMA statistics. dma_available indicates
		whether both DMA channels were obtained. dma_enabled reports the
		current dma_enable parameter; mapped transfers already queued may
		still finish with DMA after the parameter is disabled.

		tx_transfers and tx_bytes count successful host TX scatter-gather
		DMA transactions and pixel/data bytes. A 411640-byte frame uses
		13 transactions because MS_DLEN is limited to 32768 bytes.
		errors counts failures in that TX scatter-gather path. Legacy
		target/RX/duplex bounce transfers are outside these counters.
		The counters reset at probe; reading this file neither transfers
		data nor writes to the framebuffer console.
